  "description": "Authentication track abstractions for the Cirreum framework (three-pillar separation and composition surface). Defines the contracts scheme packages (ApiKey, SignedRequest, SessionTicket) implement: ISchemeSelector + SchemeCategory, CredentialTransport, ISignedRequestAlgorithm + resolver, SessionTicket primitives, [AllowPendingAuth], IAuthenticationBoundaryResolver, IAuthenticationBuilder, IUserProfileEnrichmentBuilder. Pure abstractions plus default impls (ClaimsUserProfileEnricher, DefaultAuthenticationBoundaryResolver) that ship with the contracts.",
